{%- comment -%}
  Marquee of standing promises. Everything here is a promise the checkout has
  to keep, so before adding a message check it against the others - two offers
  that cannot both apply will be read as one offer that does.

  The live example: Shopify will not let the Buy X Get Y free gift coexist
  with a percentage discount code, so "15% off your first order" and the free
  gift are mutually exclusive. The gift message carries "one offer per order"
  for that reason - the same sentence the cart drawer and the product page
  show. Do not drop that qualifier to shorten the line.

  Iki esik artik AYRI: kargo £25, hediye £30. Esit olduklari surece sepet
  cubugundaki iki etiket ust uste biniyordu ve ayni rakam mesajda iki kez
  tekrarliyordu. Rakamlari buraya elle yazma, asagidaki ship_t / gift_t
  degiskenleri tema ayarindan geliyor.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign ship_t = settings.free_shipping_threshold | default: 25 -%}
{%- assign gift_t = settings.gift_threshold | default: 30 -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Asagidaki replace zinciri, Admin'de kalmis eski blok metinlerini canlida
  duzeltir. Hediye kurali kargodan AYRI tutuluyor: "over £25" diye genel bir
  degistirme yazarsak kargo mesajini da £30 yapar.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture ship_over -%}over £{{ ship_t }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture ship_at -%}at £{{ ship_t }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture ship_amount -%}£{{ ship_t }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture gift_old -%}gift of your choice over £{{ ship_t }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture gift_new -%}gift of your choice over £{{ gift_t }}{%- endcapture -%}
<section class="announce" aria-label="Announcements">
  <div class="announce__marquee" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="announce__track">
      {%- comment -%} Render messages twice for seamless loop {%- endcomment -%}
      {% for repeat in (1..2) %}
        {% for block in section.blocks %}
          <span class="announce__item">
            {% if block.settings.icon != blank %}{{ block.settings.icon }}{% endif %}
            {{ block.settings.text | replace: '£5.95 off', '15% off' | replace: '£5.95 OFF', '15% OFF' | replace: '£5.95', '15%' | replace: ' with code "NEWLIFE"', '' | replace: ' with code NEWLIFE', '' | replace: 'NEWLIFE', '' | replace: ' or Diaper Rash Gel', '' | replace: '£12', ship_amount | replace: 'over £20', ship_over | replace: 'at £20', ship_at | replace: gift_old, gift_new }}
          </span>
        {% else %}
          <span class="announce__item">✦ Free UK shipping over £{{ ship_t }}</span>
          <span class="announce__item">✦ Free gift of your choice over £{{ gift_t }}, one offer per order</span>
          <span class="announce__item">✦ Official UK distributor for INCIA Naturals</span>
          <span class="announce__item">✦ 15% off your first order for new customers</span>
          <span class="announce__item">✦ 14-day returns, no questions</span>
          <span class="announce__item">✦ ETKO Cosmos certified · Vegan · Cruelty-free</span>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="visually-hidden">
    {% for block in section.blocks %}{{ block.settings.text | replace: '£5.95', '15%' }}. {% else %}Free UK shipping over £{{ ship_t }}. Free gift of your choice over £{{ gift_t }}, one offer per order. Official UK distributor for INCIA Naturals. 15% off your first order for new customers.{% endfor %}
  </p>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Announcement bar",
  "settings": [],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "message",
      "name": "Message",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "Text", "default": "Free UK shipping over £25" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "icon", "label": "Icon (emoji)", "default": "✦" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 6,
  "presets": [{ "name": "Announcement bar" }],
  "enabled_on": { "groups": ["header"] }
}
{% endschema %}
